       "K0094",
       "K0098"
      ],
      "place": null,
      "source": "self",
      "text": "I asked Bruno, Felix and Henrik for money a while ago, and they all said no.",
      "time": 76194,
      "topics": [
       "money"
      ]
     },
     {
