      "key": "K0120",
      "place": null,
      "source": "self",
      "text": "On Day 57: from about 16:30 to 17:15 I was at home; around 17:19 I passed through Mill Road; around 17:25 I passed through the square; from about 17:30 to 18:00 I was at the grocery; around 18:02 I passed through the square; around 18:08 I passed through Mill Road; from about 18:15 to 19:15 I was at home; around 19:12 I passed through Mill Road; from about 19:15 to 19:30 I was at the Morrow house.",
      "time": 81626,
      "topics": [
       "whereabouts"
      ]
     },
